{"about_the_game":"A classic for great fun, a virtual and improved chess game!<br />\r\nYour objective is to get the checkmate on the enemy king, but it will not be easy to get close to him with so many pieces involved to protect him.<br />\r\nThe game also shows the possible moves with each piece, thus making it easier to play or even learn!<br />\r\nPut a time limit and win whoever knocks over pieces in less time, or put no time limit and the winner will be who can give the checkmate!<br />\r\nYou can have fun with friends or with the whole family!<br />\r\nLearn how to play or improve your chess skills in a fun way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProtect you king from a checkmate!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/917550?t=1728354396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1728354396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728354396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728354396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"A classic for great fun, a virtual and improved chess game!<br />\r\nYour objective is to get the checkmate on the enemy king, but it will not be easy to get close to him with so many pieces involved to protect him.<br />\r\nThe game also shows the possible moves with each piece, thus making it easier to play or even learn!<br />\r\nPut a time limit and win whoever knocks over pieces in less time, or put no time limit and the winner will be who can give the checkmate!<br />\r\nYou can have fun with friends or with the whole family!<br />\r\n